flowchart LR
 B[Builder buckets] --> AST[Validated query AST]
 AST --> PRE[POST /api/query/preview]
 PRE --> SQL[SQL / cached membership + tag edges]
 SQL --> UI[Count + duration + tracks + revision]
 UI --> HUMAN[Owner reviews preview]
 HUMAN --> CREATE[POST /api/playlists]
 CREATE --> FREEZE[Validate revision / freeze ordered playable target]
 FREEZE --> JOB[Playlist operation + job]
 JOB --> SP[Spotify writes later]